literal to make it SAT.

00:53:12.611 --> 00:53:15.485
We pick the unSAT core
so that this works.

00:53:15.486 --> 00:53:19.285
We add clauses as long as
it remains satisfiable.

00:53:19.286 --> 00:53:22.230
So until it becomes unSAT.

00:53:22.231 --> 00:53:26.110
We flip the same literal
back in the unSAT core,

00:53:26.111 --> 00:53:28.090
to reintroduce the unsat core.

00:53:28.091 --> 00:53:30.725
So we have a satisfiable
problem here,

00:53:30.726 --> 00:53:33.990
and then we reintroduce
the unsat core by flipping a

00:53:33.991 --> 00:53:37.590
single literal to construct
the unsatisfiable problem.

00:53:37.591 --> 00:53:41.180
And we return the pair before
and after that final flip.

00:53:41.181 --> 00:53:44.570
And we train NeuroSAT
